+// Zeppelin I-442: the multisampled back depth resolved into the single-sampled one (Msaa.cpp). Vulkan
+// 1.0 has no depth resolve (VK_KHR_depth_stencil_resolve is RenderPass2): sample 0 is the pixel's depth,
+// what a reader that expects one value per pixel (the stages, the depth history, the water) gets.
+// Copyright (C) 2026 WarcraftXL
+//
